      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine beef, pork, Parmesan cheese, bread crumbs, egg, garlic, Italian seasoning, and salt in a large bowl; mix until evenly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cvZsBdtwylXKeMVB2tbiLdSAHWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275548_AirFryerMeatballs_4x3_Step_2_278-1-cea3a1ad054048d284125761b137746e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275548/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form mixture into 16 equal meatballs (a small ice cream scoop is helpful); place on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HoXiv21UwzqFB9-OB5TadXlHt6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275548_AirFryerMeatballs_4x3_Step_3_278-1-09dc4caa3fc94273bb802bced3d2fbb8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275548/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place ½ meatballs in the air fryer basket; cook 8 minutes. Shake the basket; cook 2 minutes more. Transfer to a serving plate; rest for 5 minutes. Repeat with remaining ½ meatballs.",
